From 7978fe5e608467f9d539f300845d223dcfc3e688 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: poram srinivasa rao <poramx.srinivasa.rao@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Oct 2025 15:40:19 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Fix for Firmware update with Software Manager

This commit implements the firmware update using redfish postman
tool with new service xyz.openbmc_project.Software.Manager which
changed due to upstream changes from the older service
xyz.openbmc_project.Software.BMC.Updater with
redfish-updateservice-use-dbus enabled.

So, this is like firmware update using dbus call and which copies
firmware image to /tmp/images but uses new service
xyz.openbmc_project.Software.Manager instead of
xyz.openbmc_project.Software.BMC.Updater.

Signed-off-by: P Dheeraj Srujan Kumar <p.dheeraj.srujan.kumar@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: poram srinivasa rao <poramx.srinivasa.rao@intel.com>

Upstream-Status: Pending
